 Custom AccessDenied Exception
 ===============================
 - Important Configuration Point
 - http.httpBasic(...)
 - is configuring the HTTP Basic authentication mechanism and its AuthenticationEntryPoint.
 
 - Whereas:
 
 - http.exceptionHandling(...)
 - is configuring Spring Security's exception-handling behavior, including the AccessDeniedHandler.
 - So these two configurations are related, but they configure different parts of the exception-handling flow.
 